/// Immutable per-student calendar authority for one quota ledger version.
/// The stored timezone is the source of truth for all derived windows.

/// One immutable-timezone day, ISO week, or month window. Monetary exposure
/// is authoritative only on month rows; day/week USD fields stay zero.

/// Immutable request-to-window lineage. Settlement must use these exact
/// window identities and preserve both conservation equations.

/// Append-only evidence/correction audit for late generation settlement.

model WeaknessAnalysis {
